+```python
+class Validated[T]:
+    expected_type = TypeVarValue[T]()
+
+    @takes_alias                       # so cls is the alias, e.g. Validated[int]
+    @classmethod
+    def ensure(cls, val: object) -> T:
+        assert isinstance(val, cls.expected_type)
+        return val
