+# types and unpacks/flattens in place; a ``ParamSpec`` (``**P``) binds to a
+# parameter list. Both are invisible to ``_is_typevar`` and need their own
+# binding (variadic position) and substitution (unpack flattening / Callable).
+# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
